{"articleNo":"570508","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=570508&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] [사전 예고] 한국장학재단 국가장학금 학자금 지원구간 체계 개편(2027년 적용) [재안내]","writer":"학생과","writeDate":"2026.07.19","hit":"99763","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 0.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">[한국장학재단]&nbsp;</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">국가장학금 등 학자금 지원을 위한 지원 구간 체계 개편 안내</span></b></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 0.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></b></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 0.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">한국장학재단 학자금 지원구간 체계 개편 내용을 다음과 같이 사전 공표하오니, 2027학년도 국가장학금 신청 시 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 29.1pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 0.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -29.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 14pt;\">◦</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192); font-size: 14pt;\">개편방향: 구간별 지원단가 수준에 따라</span></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">5구간 체계</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">로 개편하고, 명칭을</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(206, 251, 201);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">'1~10구간'에서 '</span><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">가~마구간'으로</span></b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192); color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192); color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">변경</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 29.1pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 0.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -29.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -38.8px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 14pt;\">◦</span><span style=\"text-indent: -38.8px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;추진일정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 29.1pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 0.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -29.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -38.8px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; - 2026년 사전 공표: 학자금 지원구간 체계 개편 사전 공표</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 29.1pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 0.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -29.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -38.8px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; -</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><u style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(206, 251, 201);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\"><b>2027년 본격 적용</b>: </span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">2027-1학기 국가장학금 신청 시</span></b></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">, 2026년에 사전 공표한 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">학자금 지원구간 도입</span></b></span></span></u></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 29.1pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 0.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -29.1pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -38.8px;\"><u style=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(206, 251, 201);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><b><br></b></span></span></u></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmDYHoQdkgLAsgewNYGN4CsB2AJAWwEkB3AFwBsBNEgOQHFkAVAOiwAcBzIA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"></p><p><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
